WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.335
-The three of you
are very close,

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.837
but I wanted to see
just how close you are

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.205
in a game we call
"Know Your Bro."

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:08.440
Now, here's how the game works.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.943
One of you will wear
noise-canceling headphones

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:14.113
while the other two answer
a question about you, okay?

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.214
Then you'll take
the headphones off,

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.515
and we'll see
if your answer matches.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:17.683
If it does, you get a point.
Make sense?

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:18.718
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:19.986
-Okay, here we go.
Let's do this.

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:21.320
Nick, the first question
is about you,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.789
so please put these on.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:23.923
-So it's about me?
-This is about you.

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.991
Okay? But you can't listen.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.025
You can't hear
what the question is.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.293
-Okay.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.329
-All right, let me see if you
can -- Is it loud?

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.565
Good? Good? Good? Okay.
All right. Can't hear you.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.633
-Baby shark?

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:37.403
-All right.
It's not baby shark.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:38.804
It should have been.
It should have been.

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:41.273
Here we go. All right.
All right, Kevin and Joe.

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:42.308
All right.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.243
What would Nick say is the thing

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:46.812
you're most jealous of him for?

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:50.716
-Oh, he took batting practice
with the Dodgers.

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:54.020
I thought that was pretty cool.
Pretty jealous of that.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.023
-His shoe collection.
-Okay. Really?

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.224
-Yeah.
-He's got a good one?

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.992
-He does have an amazing shoe
collection, yeah.

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.060
-Really? And you think
that's what he'll say?

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.162
Like, "Oh, you guys
are jealous."

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.664
-Like, he has so many shoes.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.866
-You go visit his house,
his, like, closet is filled.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.267
-Really?
-Yeah. I think -- Yeah.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.003
He has more shoes than Priyanka,
I'm pretty sure.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.238
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.974
-Okay, everybody.
All right, all right, all right.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.442
Pause. Ready?

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:19.679
Nick, we have --
The question that I asked

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.981
your brothers -- I said, "What
would Nick say is the thing

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.783
that you're most jealous
of him for?"

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.217
-Oh.

00:01:25.217 --> 00:01:27.587
-What are they jealous
of you for?

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.323
-What could they have said?

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:34.427
Like, clothing
or, like, a thing?

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.662
What? Anything.
-Could be.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:42.468
-Maybe, like, performing
at The White House a few times.

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:46.840
-Whoa! [ Laughs ]
Not to brag.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.110
Clang! Clang!
Not to drop anything.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.379
Wow! Excuse me?

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.247
Just performing --
Just humble --

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:57.617
"I guess I performed
at The White House."

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.718
-Okay, sorry.

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:00.253
-I mean, yeah.
-All right.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.554
This is for Kevin.

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.355
-This party playlist on here
is great, by the way.

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:05.024
-Isn't that
an insane song, right?

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.527
Oh, you hear it? All right.
So, Kevin's going for it.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:10.096
Okay, he's -- All right.
Ready, Joe?

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.531
-Yes.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.734
-Nick, what is the worst thing
that Kevin ever did as a kid

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:18.805
that your parents didn't know
about at the time?

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:23.008
-Oh, wow.

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:24.544
-I mean, he snuck out
a few times.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.812
-Yeah, I think he, like --
Yeah, he snuck out a few times.

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:30.783
-And got away with it...I think.
Well, until now, I guess.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:31.884
-And what did he do?

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:32.886
-He had had
a couple beers before 21.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.020
-Ooh!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.120
-Whoa!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:37.423
-Scandalous.
-Scandalous.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:40.226
-You think that's what
he will say?

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:43.730
-No. And he bought a pack of
cigarettes or something.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.231
-Oh, yeah, it's getting
worse and worse.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.999
-It's getting worse and worse.

00:02:46.999 --> 00:02:50.069
Let's stop there.
Let's see what he says.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:53.806
-I like this game a lot. Okay.
You want to pause the -- Ready?

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.341
Kevin.
It's a good track, right?

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:58.077
-That song is intense.
-I'm dropping it next week.

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:59.445
-It's awesome.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.714
-Kevin, I asked your brothers,
what is the worst thing

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.017
